⬇️FULL RECIPE⬇️
283 calories 41g protein (yes for the whole pint)😋🤤

Chocolate Fudge Brownie Protein Ice Cream 😋🍦

Original recipe from my Recipe Book
Check out the link in my bio for my Creami Recipe Books with over 100 recipes like this one!

- 1 Chocolate Protein Shake (I like the ones from Raw or @Nurri)
- 20g @Lakanto Monk Fruit sweetener
- 10g cocoa powder
- 1g (¼ tsp) salt
- 1g (¼ tsp) xanthan gum
Toppings:
- ½ of an @Prime Bites Protein Treats Protein Brownie (I used the Chocolate Glazed Donut flavor)
283 cal 9g C, 8g F, 41g P

Instructions:
1. Blend all ingredients for the base and freeze (at least 16 hours)
2. Run under hot water for at least 60 seconds
3. Spin on “Lite Ice Cream” setting
4. Scrape down sides with a butter knife
5. Spin on “Respin” setting
6. Respin again if powdery
7. Top with the crumbled up brownie

